sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Cliente as Cliente/Checkout
    participant API as Payment API
    participant UC as Payment UseCase
    participant Redis as Redis Idempotency
    participant Tax as Tax Engine IBS/CBS
    participant DB as Payment DB
    participant GW as Gateway de Pagamento
    participant Outbox as Outbox Publisher
    participant Broker as Broker
    participant Cart as Carrinho Consumer
    participant DLQ as Retry/DLQ

    Cliente->>API: POST /v1/payments + Idempotency-Key
    API->>API: Validar autenticação, schema e headers
    API->>UC: ProcessPayment(request)
    UC->>Redis: SET NX idempotency key + payload hash

    alt Chave já concluída e payload igual
        Redis-->>UC: Resposta armazenada
        UC-->>API: Resultado idempotente
        API-->>Cliente: 200 resposta original
    else Chave existente com payload diferente
        Redis-->>UC: Hash divergente
        UC-->>API: IdempotencyConflict
        API-->>Cliente: 409 Conflict
    else Nova chave reservada
        UC->>Tax: CalculateTaxes(amount, destination, rule version)
        Tax-->>UC: IBS, CBS, total e versão da regra
        UC->>GW: ProcessCharge(token, amount, currency)

        alt Gateway aprovado
            GW-->>UC: APPROVED + provider transaction id
            UC->>DB: BEGIN
            UC->>DB: Persist payment + tax calculation
            UC->>DB: Insert Outbox PaymentProcessed
            UC->>DB: COMMIT
            UC->>Redis: Store final response TTL 24h
            UC-->>API: APPROVED
            API-->>Cliente: 201 Created
            Outbox->>DB: Read pending outbox event
            Outbox->>Broker: Publish PaymentProcessed (confirm)
            Broker-->>Outbox: Publish confirm
            Broker->>Cart: Deliver event
            Cart->>Cart: Check event_id idempotency
            alt Evento ainda não processado
                Cart->>Cart: Atualizar pedido/carrinho
                Cart->>Cart: Mark event_id processed
                Cart-->>Broker: ACK
            else Evento duplicado
                Cart-->>Broker: ACK sem reaplicar efeito
            end
        else Gateway pendente
            GW-->>UC: PENDING
            UC->>DB: Persist payment PENDING + tax calculation
            UC->>Redis: Store PENDING response TTL 24h
            UC-->>API: PENDING
            API-->>Cliente: 202 Accepted
        else Gateway rejeitou
            GW-->>UC: REJECTED + reason code
            UC->>DB: Persist rejected payment + tax calculation
            UC->>Redis: Store REJECTED response TTL 24h
            UC-->>API: REJECTED
            API-->>Cliente: 402 Payment Required
        else Timeout ou erro transitório
            GW-->>UC: timeout/temporary error
            UC->>UC: Retry gateway conforme política
            alt Limite excedido
                UC->>DB: Persist PENDING/FAILED para reconciliação
                UC-->>API: ServiceUnavailable
                API-->>Cliente: 503 Retry-After
            else Recuperado
                GW-->>UC: Resultado final
            end
        end
    end

    Note over Broker,DLQ: Falha transitória do consumidor
    Cart-->>Broker: NACK controlado
    Broker->>DLQ: Retry queue 10s/60s/300s
    DLQ->>Broker: Reentrega na fila principal
    Broker->>Cart: Nova tentativa
    Note over Broker,DLQ: Falha permanente ou retries esgotados
    Cart->>DLQ: Publica evento + motivo + headers
    Cart-->>Broker: ACK da mensagem original
